    "https://myusf.stfrancis.edu/portal/secure/student/deposit": {
      "title": "Login",
      "description": "Login Sign in to continue Username Password Log In Forgot your Password? What is this? Help × Close Forgot your password? You can reset it using an email on file with us. Are you a parent/guardian? If your student has set up a parent account for you, you can access it here . Special Student? If you fall into any of the following categories, you can access your online courses by clicking on the respective link. I am a Swedish American Hospital Student (Radiation Therapy/Radiography) I am an Online Certificate in Franciscan Studies Student I am taking a non-credit course with an online component None of these! If you still haven't resolved your issue, you can visit the Technology Support Center for more options. Close What is this? × Close The University of St. Francis uses a \"single sign-on\" program called CAS in order to let you move seamlessly between its various online services.\r\n                                            These include the MyUSF portal, the Canvas online learning platform, CampusLabs Course Evaluations, and many other ancillary services which let you use one login to access all of your college information. Whenever you see this login screen, it means you are accessing a service that has partnered with USF to create a \"one-click\" experience for you! Close The University of St. Francis — A Catholic Franciscan University"
    },
